{"step_index":234,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T12:35:51Z","input_tokens":4905,"cache_read_tokens":150576,"output_tokens":3079,"thinking":"Removing the `customInputDrawer` is the primary focus, aiming to declutter the interface and simplify Area 1. This involves identifying and eliminating the section encompassing the \"Example:\" dropdown, the \"Input List\" display, and the associated chips. The goal is a cleaner presentation of \"Your Code\" in Area 1.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Teach Me This Code — Thonny-Style Visual Execution & Memory Model</title>\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:,\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Clean, Simple Top Navigation Bar -->\n  <header class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"brand-area\">\n      <span class=\"teacher-badge\">Teach Me This Code</span>\n      <span id=\"stepProgressLabel\" class=\"step-progress-label\">Step 1 of 50</span>\n      <span id=\"activeScopeBadge\" class=\"scope-pill scope-global\">GLOBAL SCOPE</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Simple Navigation Controls + Thonny Sub-Expression Stepper -->\n    <nav class=\"nav-controls\" aria-label=\"Step Navigation\">\n      <button id=\"btnPrev\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Go back one step (Left Arrow)\">← Previous</button>\n      <button id=\"btnSubStep\" class=\"btn-nav btn-substep\" title=\"Step through internal sub-expressions on this line (F7)\">🔍 Sub-Expr (F7)</button>\n      <button id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn-nav btn-next-prominent\" title=\"Explain the next step (Right Arrow)\">Next Step →</button>\n      <button id=\"btnAutoPlay\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Automatically step through the code\">▶ Auto Play</button>\n      <button id=\"btnRestart\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Start over from Step 1\">↺ Restart</button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"secondary-actions\">\n      <button id=\"btnEditCode\" class=\"btn-small-primary\">✏️ Paste / Edit Code</button>\n      <button id=\"btnToggleAdvanced\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Advanced View</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Error / Validation Banner (Hidden unless there is an error) -->\n  <div id=\"validationBanner\" class=\"validation-banner hidden\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Overview Banner -->\n  <div class=\"overview-strip\">\n    <span class=\"overview-label\">Goal:</span>\n    <span id=\"overviewText\">Paste or edit any Python program on the left to visualize every step, variable scope, and memory address.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================\n       MAIN 3-AREA THONNY-STYLE WORKSPACE\n       1. Your Code (Left)\n       2. Step-by-Step Teaching & Sub-Expression Evaluator (Center)\n       3. Scope Isolation & Stack/Heap Reference Visualizer (Right)\n       ========================================================= -->\n  <main class=\"three-area-workspace\">\n\n    <!-- AREA 1: YOUR CODE (LEFT) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-code\" aria-label=\"Your Code\">\n      <div class=\"area-header-row\">\n        <h2 class=\"area-heading\">Your Code</h2>\n        <div class=\"code-header-actions\">\n          <span id=\"codeScopeIndicator\" class=\"code-scope-tag\">Scope: Global</span>\n          <button id=\"btnAnalyzeCode\" class=\"btn-small-primary hidden\">▶ Run Code</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"codeLinesContainer\" class=\"code-view\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Code Editor Textarea when user clicks \"Paste / Edit Code\" -->\n      <div id=\"liveEditorWrap\" class=\"live-editor-wrap hidden\">\n        <textarea id=\"codeTextarea\" class=\"code-textarea\" placeholder=\"Paste any Python code here...\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea>\n        <div class=\"editor-input-bar\">\n          <label class=\"drawer-label\" for=\"inputPlaygroundField\">Optional Function Input:</label>\n          <input id=\"inputPlaygroundField\" type=\"text\" class=\"drawer-input\" placeholder=\"e.g. nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4] (leave empty if your code calls itself)\" spellcheck=\"false\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREA 2: TEACHING AREA & THONNY EXPRESSION STEPPER (CENTER) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-teaching\" aria-label=\"Step-by-Step Explanation\">\n      <div class=\"teaching-card-inner\">\n\n        <!-- Step Heading -->\n        <div class=\"teach-header-row\">\n          <h1 id=\"teachStepTitle\" class=\"teach-step-title\">Step 1: Create the variable</h1>\n          <span id=\"teachScopeBadge\" class=\"scope-pill scope-global\">GLOBAL SCOPE</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Current Code Line Box -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">Code:</div>\n          <div id=\"teachCodeBox\" class=\"teach-code-box\">c = 0</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- TASK 2.1, 2.2, 2.3: THONNY-STYLE STEP-BY-STEP SUB-EXPRESSION EVALUATOR -->\n        <div id=\"thonnyExprBox\" class=\"thonny-expr-card\">\n          <div class=\"thonny-expr-header\">\n            <span class=\"thonny-badge\">Thonny Expression Evaluator</span>\n            <span id=\"thonnySubStepCounter\" class=\"thonny-subcounter\">Evaluation 1 of 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"thonnyLiveCode\" class=\"thonny-live-code\"></div>\n          <div id=\"thonnyFocusNote\" class=\"thonny-focus-note\"></div>\n          <div id=\"thonnyTrailChips\" class=\"thonny-trail-chips\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step Calculation Breakdown